## Approach

New `sutra_orient` MCP tool that assembles convention-aware orientation for a given scope (component name, component ID, or file path). It reads from the DB — conventions, templates, snapshots, waivers, proposals — without triggering FCA recomputation. Placed in the **core** tier so agents can call it routinely without enabling analysis. The scope resolves to zero or more components; the response includes both component-scoped and global conventions, grouped by lifecycle state with appropriate messaging.

